From 34f3fa405c300093de554bec0e38c607908c3bf2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jules Youngberg <julesdayoungberg@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 23:03:09 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 6/8] Group FX foley folders by the material their name gives

One "foley" group held 233 folders. Name rules ahead of the foley band put them
under foley-metal, foley-doors-wood, foley-glass, foley-paper, foley-footsteps,
foley-mechanical, foley-clicks and foley-tonal; the rest stay "foley".

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 src/fourier/packs/curate_config.py | 10 +++-
 tests/data/tunables_snapshot.json  | 90 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 tests/test_folder_groups.py        | 17 ++++++
 3 files changed, 116 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/src/fourier/packs/curate_config.py b/src/fourier/packs/curate_config.py
